et_count":0},"text":"🔥中国科技股跌幅居前，但仍未到击球区\n📉科创50指数半年大跌近40%，创业板下跌36%，头部芯片公司市值近乎腰斩。该指数4‑6月曾暴涨75%，当时外资大举进场，三季度北向资金流出900亿，资金大幅出逃引发回调。\n🧑","url":"https://x.com/haotianche21370/status/2112097289640804838"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112439822715617280","3_2112439822711451649","3_2112439822694690816","3_2112439821859995648"]},"author_id":"1142564365922471937","created_at":"2026-10-20T07:04:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112439835273396684"],"id":"2112439835273396684","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":257,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"四只宽基ETF成交额放量\n10月20日尾盘，上证50ETF华夏（510050）显著放量，成交额突破50亿元，科创50ETF华夏（588000）成交额突破90亿元。\n\n沪深300ETF华夏（510330）、沪深300ETF嘉实（159919）尾盘亦大幅放量，成交额分别超40亿元、25亿元。 https://t.co/pqAiQzq5dJ","url":"https://x.com/xu159411209/status/2112439835273396684"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112445796063105024"]},"author_id":"1548946739884748800","created_at":"2026-10-20T07:28:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112445812932563084"],"id":"2112445812932563084","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":60,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"神秘大哥在收盘前半小时开始突袭：\n\n科创50ETF：成交额突破90亿元\n上证50ETF：成交额55亿元\n\n最后8分钟又加码：\n\n两只沪深300ETF：65亿元\n\n现在几十亿就能稳住双创....这是个好信号。#A股 https://t.co/GgKNVn90nR","url":"https://x.com/x001fx/status/2112445812932563084"},{"author_id":"997722661844287488","created_at":"2026-10-20T12:50:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112526866754204030"],"id":"2112526866754204030","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":10023,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"神秘大哥在收盘前半小时开始突袭： \n科创50ETF：成交额突破90亿元 \n上证50ETF：成交额55亿元 \n最后8分钟又加码： 两只沪深300ETF：65亿元","url":"https://x.com/dacefupan/status/2112526866754204030"},{"author_id":"1915386812283162624","created_at":"2026-10-20T08:40:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112464035782529241"],"id":"2112464035782529241","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,